{"id":"9f9fb3e4bf8fdf7c","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-hornfunctional.md","title":"Functional inequality for Hornness","display":"thm-hornfunctional — Functional inequality for Hornness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-hornfunctional","aliases":["27-thm-hornfunctional"],"display":"thm-hornfunctional — Functional inequality for Hornness","depends_on":["[[27-df-hornfunc]]","[[27-thm-hornchar]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-hornfunctional"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-hornfunctional</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hornfunctional — Functional inequality for Hornness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" href=\"?note=bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" title=\"27-df-hornfunc\">27-df-hornfunc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"584eb5a4dd07e7fb\" href=\"?note=584eb5a4dd07e7fb\" title=\"27-thm-hornchar\">27-thm-hornchar</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</li>\n<li>For <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\preceq b\">\\(a\\preceq b\\)</span> means <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall i\\in[n]\\,(a_i\\le b_i)\">\\(\\forall i\\in[n]\\,(a_i\\le b_i)\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a\\wedge b)_i=\\min(a_i,b_i)\">\\((a\\wedge b)_i=\\min(a_i,b_i)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a\\vee b)_i=\\max(a_i,b_i)\">\\((a\\vee b)_i=\\max(a_i,b_i)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\)</span> is defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" href=\"?note=bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" title=\"27-df-hornfunc\">27-df-hornfunc</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;\\left(f\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a\\wedge b)\\le\\max(f(a),f(b)))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;\\left(f\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a\\wedge b)\\le\\max(f(a),f(b)))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §6.3, Corollary 6.2，印刷页 278–279，PDF 第 302–303 页（从 1 计数）。 已核对完整证明：唯一可能违反该不等式的情形是两个假点的交为真；其余布尔值情形不等式自动成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-hornfunc","status":"resolved","id":"bb96ce122f7cd0ef","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-hornfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-hornchar","status":"resolved","id":"584eb5a4dd07e7fb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-thm-hornchar]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$; $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$, as in [[27-df-boolfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-hornfunc","status":"resolved","id":"bb96ce122f7cd0ef","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$ is defined in [[27-df-hornfunc]].","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"a\\preceq b","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall i\\in[n]\\,(a_i\\le b_i)","display":false},{"tex":"(a\\wedge b)_i=\\min(a_i,b_i)","display":false},{"tex":"(a\\vee b)_i=\\max(a_i,b_i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;\\left(f\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a\\wedge b)\\le\\max(f(a),f(b)))\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1159,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-437","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-hornfunctional|thm-hornfunctional — Functional inequality for Hornness]]"},{"id":"1d6715331cf48592","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$、$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$，$r\\geq1$ 为整数。$\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_r$ 见 [[27-df-boolexpr]]；$\\mathrm{FEq}$、$\\models_n$、$X_i^{(r)}$ 及语法的 $\\neg,\\wedge,\\vee$ 见 [[27-df-functionalequation]]。$\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$、$\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$、$\\mathrm{AffineFunc}_n$ 分别见 [[27-df-monotone]]、[[27-thm-hornfunctional]]、[[27-thm-affinechar]]。有限语法析取由下节递归构造；$\\langle\\tau_1,\\ldots,\\tau_s\\rangle$ 代表以 $[s]$ 为域的表达式序列，$\\langle\\tau_1\\rangle$ 是长度为1的序列。"}],"outgoing":["bb96ce122f7cd0ef","584eb5a4dd07e7fb","5d10aed668d85817"]}